{"seq":1,"slug":"unix-pipeline-modern-practice","title":"Unix 管道现代实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/modern-cli-ecosystem/pipeline-composition/unix-pipeline-modern-practice","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"unix-管道现代实践\">Unix 管道现代实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Unix 管道是 1973 年由 Ken Thompson 引入的概念，至今仍是命令行生产力的核心机制。但在 2026 年，现代工具对管道范式做出了本质性增强：ripgrep 的结构化输出可以被精确解析，fzf 在管道中引入交互式「断点」，bat 智能检测管道上下文切换行为，fd 实现并行管道执行。本文从管道基础出发，讲解这些现代增强如何改变管道设计思维。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"经典管道-vs-现代管道\">经典管道 vs 现代管道</h3><p>现代管道保留「一行一条记录」的文本流基础，但在数据格式、交互性、并行化三个维度上增加了能力层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;rg --json&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;jq: structured extract&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;fzf: interactive node&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;xargs -P4: parallel act&quot;]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|&quot;pipefail&quot;| E[&quot;error short-circuit&quot;]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|&quot;--ansi&quot;| F[&quot;color preserved end-to-end&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"rg --json\"] --&gt; B[\"jq: structured extract\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"fzf: interactive node\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"xargs -P4: parallel act\"]\n    A -.-&gt;|\"pipefail\"| E[\"error short-circuit\"]\n    C -.-&gt;|\"--ansi\"| F[\"color preserved end-to-end\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>经典管道</th>\n<th>现代管道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>纯文本行</td>\n<td>结构化输出（JSON、分隔符）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互性</td>\n<td>完全非交互</td>\n<td>fzf 引入交互式选择节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行化</td>\n<td>串行（左到右）</td>\n<td>fd -x 实现并行执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色处理</td>\n<td>管道中丢失</td>\n<td>--color=always 保留 ANSI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>忽略（pipefail off）</td>\n<td>set -o pipefail + 工具级错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"管道中的颜色传递\">管道中的颜色传递</h3><p>现代工具默认行为：终端输出带颜色，管道输出无颜色。需要显式传递：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 错误：颜色在管道中丢失&#10;rg &quot;pattern&quot; | fzf         # fzf 看到的是无色文本&#10;&#10;# 正确：显式保留颜色&#10;rg &quot;pattern&quot; --color=always | fzf --ansi&#10;&#10;# bat 的智能行为&#10;bat file.py               # 终端：有高亮&#10;bat file.py | head        # 管道：自动退化为纯文本&#10;bat --color=always file.py | fzf --ansi  # 强制保留\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 错误：颜色在管道中丢失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # fzf 看到的是无色文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 正确：显式保留颜色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --color=always</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ansi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># bat 的智能行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.py</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 终端：有高亮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.py</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 管道：自动退化为纯文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --color=always</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.py</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ansi</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 强制保留</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"基础管道模式\">基础管道模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Pattern 1: 搜索 → 过滤 → 操作&#10;rg -l &quot;TODO&quot; | fzf | xargs vim&#10;&#10;# Pattern 2: 列出 → 筛选 → 批量执行&#10;fd -e ts | fzf -m | xargs -I {} prettier --write {}&#10;&#10;# Pattern 3: 生成 → 转换 → 输出&#10;git log --oneline | fzf | awk &#39;{print $1}&#39; | xargs git show&#10;&#10;# Pattern 4: 聚合 → 排序 → 展示&#10;fd -e ts -x wc -l | sort -rn | head -20 | bat -l csv\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Pattern 1: 搜索 → 过滤 → 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"TODO\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Pattern 2: 列出 → 筛选 → 批量执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -I</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Pattern 3: 生成 → 转换 → 输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Pattern 4: 聚合 → 排序 → 展示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> csv</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"结构化输出管道\">结构化输出管道</h3><p>ripgrep 的 JSON 输出让管道处理变得更精确：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ripgrep JSON 输出 → jq 解析 → 精确提取&#10;rg --json &quot;TODO&quot; | jq -r &#39;&#10;  select(.type == &quot;match&quot;) |&#10;  &quot;\\(.data.path.text):\\(.data.line_number):\\(.data.lines.text)&quot;&#10;&#39; | head -20&#10;&#10;# 按文件分组统计匹配数&#10;rg --json &quot;console.log&quot; | jq -r &#39;&#10;  select(.type == &quot;match&quot;) | .data.path.text&#10;&#39; | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn&#10;&#10;# fd + stat 构建文件元信息管道&#10;fd -e ts --exec stat -f &#39;%z %N&#39; {} | sort -rn | head -10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ripgrep JSON 输出 → jq 解析 → 精确提取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"TODO\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  select(.type == \"match\") |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"\\(.data.path.text):\\(.data.line_number):\\(.data.lines.text)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按文件分组统计匹配数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"console.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  select(.type == \"match\") | .data.path.text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># fd + stat 构建文件元信息管道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%z %N'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -10</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交互式管道节点\">交互式管道节点</h3><p>fzf 可以在管道的任意位置插入交互式选择，形成「人在回路中」的管道设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 管道中间插入 fzf 选择&#10;rg -l &quot;deprecated&quot; |          # 列出包含 deprecated 的文件&#10;  fzf -m --preview &#39;rg --color=always &quot;deprecated&quot; {}&#39; |  # 交互式选择&#10;  xargs sed -i &#39;s/deprecated/legacy/g&#39;  # 批量替换&#10;&#10;# 多次交互：选文件 → 选行 → 操作&#10;file=$(fd -e py | fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always {}&#39;)&#10;line=$(rg -n &quot;def &quot; &quot;$file&quot; | fzf | cut -d: -f1)&#10;${EDITOR:-vim} &quot;$file&quot; +$line\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 管道中间插入 fzf 选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"deprecated\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 列出包含 deprecated 的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rg --color=always \"deprecated\" {}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 交互式选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/deprecated/legacy/g'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 批量替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 多次交互：选文件 → 选行 → 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> py</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fzf</span><s